A boolean attribute does not start with an underscore

```
{_x_}

{_x_} y
.
<p><u>x</u></p>
<p><u>x</u> y</p>
```

```
{#_id ._c _k=1 _="on click"}
para
.
<p id="_id" class="_c" _k="1" _="on click">para</p>
```

```
{_foo}
para
.
<p>{_foo}
para</p>
```

```
[x]{_u=""}
.
<p><span _u="">x</span></p>
```
